<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">glycherm</unclear> wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">es</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">der</unclear> gemeinen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herrschafften</unclear> halben, so
